  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"一款由Serilum制作的模组。用心打造，为Fabric、Forge和Neo平台提供众多活跃模组！\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg&w=400\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://modrinth.com/user/Serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg&w=400\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg&w=400\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"关于模组\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>「追随者传送太棒了」能让你的狼和猫轻松脱离困境。在原版游戏中，每次传送时，你的追随者都会被留在原地。有了这个模组，你可以轻松带着宠物回到基地。当传送即将发生时，它会检查玩家周围非坐下的追随者。如果发现任何追随者，它们会被传送到玩家即将到达的确切位置。</p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"依赖项\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2><p><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/collective\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg&w=502\" alt=\"需要Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/modpack/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg&w=700\" alt=\"包含于原版体验整合包\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg&w=440\" alt=\"运行环境：服务器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"可配置\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://serilum.com/configuration-guide\" target=\"_blank\"><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg&w=440\" alt=\"配置指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;所有可用配置选项：</p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><span><strong>disableFollowerDamageAfterTeleport</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 true<br>启用后，会在传送后短时间内禁用追随者的伤害。这可以防止因目标位置估算错误而导致的摔落伤害或窒息伤害。<br><br><span><strong>durationInSecondsDamageShouldBeDisabled</strong></span>&nbsp;&nbsp;默认值 20，最小值 0，最大值 86400<br>当disableFollowerDamageAfterTeleport启用时，传送后伤害应被禁用的时长（秒）。</p>\n</details>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p>宠物随传送一同到达：</p>\n<details><summary>显示详情</summary>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/followers-teleport-too/a.webp\" alt=\"\"></p>\n</details>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><strong>你再也不用把伙伴丢下了！</strong></span></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://wsrv.nl/?url=https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg&w=1676\" alt=\"备注与链接\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span><strong>你可以自由地在任何整合包中使用此模组，前提是下载链接仍保留在CurseForge或Modrinth生态系统中。</strong></span><br><br><span>可访问<a href=\"https://serilum.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Serilum.com</a>查看所有模组的概览和更多信息。</span><br><span><br>如有问题、创意、建议或其他事宜，请前往<a href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\">Github仓库</a>。谢谢！</span><span><br><br></span></p>",
